### Credential Precedence

1. Values set directly in the provider configuration block
2. Environment variables (`APPWRITE_ENDPOINT`, `APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID`, `APPWRITE_API_KEY`)

## Project Scoping

The `project_id` can be set at the provider level as a default for all resources, or overridden per-resource. This is useful when managing resources across multiple projects from a single configuration.

